# Accepted vulnerabilities, read by every Trivy scan (CI, release) and by tools/npm-audit.mjs for
# `npm audit`. Each entry needs a reason and an expiry (exp:YYYY-MM-DD); after it the scan fails
# again. Only a finding without any fix may be listed, and it is fixed as soon as a fix exists
# (docs/security-scan.md; PLAN task 22.15). The Phase 23 gate requires this file to be empty.
#
# Empty since 2026-11-19: its only entry, picomatch 4.0.7 (CVE-2026-112366 / GHSA-fc5q-39xc-vjpf,
# accepted on 2026-11-18), was withdrawn by the advisory itself on 2026-11-18.
